#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:1
msgid "llvm-dwarfutil - A tool to copy and manipulate debug info"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:6
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:8
msgid "{program}`llvm-dwarfutil` \\[*options*\\] *input* *output*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:10
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:12
msgid "{program}`llvm-dwarfutil` is a tool to copy and manipulate debug info."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:14
msgid ""
"In basic usage, it makes a semantic copy of the input to the output. If any "
"options are specified, the output may be modified along the way, e.g. by "
"removing unused debug info."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:18
msgid ""
"If \"-\" is specified for the input file, the input is read from the "
"program's standard input stream. If \"-\" is specified for the output file, "
"the output is written to the standard output stream of the program."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:22
msgid "The tool is still in active development."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:24
msgid "COMMAND-LINE OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:27
msgid ""
"Removes pieces of debug information related to discarded sections. When the "
"linker does section garbage collection the abandoned debug info is left "
"behind. Such abandoned debug info references address ranges using tombstone "
"values. Thus, when this option is specified, the tool removes debug info "
"which is marked with the tombstone value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:33
#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:41
msgid "That option is enabled by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:37
msgid ""
"Remove duplicated types (if \"One Definition Rule\" is supported by source "
"language). Keeps first type definition and removes other definitions, "
"potentially significantly reducing the size of output debug info."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:45
msgid "Print a summary of command line options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:49
msgid "Disable {option}`--garbage-collection`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:53
msgid "Disable {option}`--odr-deduplication`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:57
msgid "Disable {option}`--separate-debug-file`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:61
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum number (`n`) of simultaneous threads to use for "
"processing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:66
msgid ""
"Generate separate file containing output debug info. Using {program}`llvm-"
"dwarfutil` with that option equals to the following set of commands:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:78
msgid "\\<value> can be one of the following values:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:80
msgid ""
"`bfd`: zero for all addresses and [1,1] for DWARF v4 (or less) address "
"ranges and exec."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:81
msgid ""
"`maxpc`: -1 for all addresses and -2 for DWARF v4 (or less) address ranges."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:82
msgid "`universal`: both `bfd` and `maxpc`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:83
msgid "`exec`: match with address ranges of executable sections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:85
msgid "The value `universal` is used by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:89
msgid "Enable verbose logging. This option disables multi-thread mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:93
msgid "Run the DWARF verifier on the output DWARF debug info."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:97
msgid "Print the version of this program."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:100
msgid "SUPPORTED FORMATS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:102
msgid ""
"The following formats are currently supported by {program}`llvm-dwarfutil`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:104
msgid "ELF"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:106
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:108
msgid ""
"{program}`llvm-dwarfutil` exits with a non-zero exit code if there is an "
"error. Otherwise, it exits with code 0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:111
msgid "BUGS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-dwarfutil.md:113
msgid ""
